    },
    {
      "id": "gemini",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Gemini Flash\n**Preprocessor**\n\n1M token context, free tier.\nBulk analysis, large file ingestion, context compaction before Claude/Opus.\n\n`gemini-review.sh`",
      "x": -760, "y": -120,
      "width": 340, "height": 180,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "codex",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Codex\n**Reviewer**\n\nIsolated well-scoped tasks, code review, second opinions, parallel execution.\n\n`codex-review.sh`",
